  "description": "Answer Engine Optimization for Umbraco. Exposes your published content to\n      LLMs and AI answer engines by dynamically serving an /llms.txt index, an\n      /llms-full.txt full-content dump, and a Markdown rendering of any page when\n      the URL ends in \".md\" — all generated from the live content cache, no\n      editor work required. Also auto-injects schema.org JSON-LD (Organization,\n      WebSite, Article, breadcrumbs, FAQ) into every page and ships an\n      \"AI Crawlers\" backoffice dashboard that tracks visits from GPTBot,\n      ClaudeBot, PerplexityBot and 20+ other AI crawlers (privacy-safe: no IPs\n      stored). Zero-config install via an Umbraco pipeline filter; fully\n      configurable through appsettings.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
